commit 751912a7b957fecbf7cf1d5959c9ec151e685a3b
Author:     recky-c <ruiqicheng510@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Mon Oct 26 11:39:12 2026 +0800
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: Mon Oct 26 11:39:12 2026 +0800

    [Refactor][Attention] Unify PCP/DCP flag and helper naming (#19334)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Standardize PCP/DCP configuration flags as `use_pcp` / `use_dcp` and
    helper functions as `is_pcp_enabled()` / `is_dcp_enabled()`. Update
    callers and existing tests, and evaluate DCP enablement from the current
    configuration rather than a process-wide cached result.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    CPU composition tests: 26 passed.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: recky-c <ruiqicheng510@gmail.com>
    Signed-off-by: chengruiqi (C) <c00913489@china.huawei.com>
    Co-authored-by: chengruiqi (C) <c00913489@china.huawei.com>

